<title>GREECE: Greek industrial output down 1.1pct y/y in October.</title>
<headline>Greek industrial output down 1.1pct y/y in October.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's industrial production fell provisionally 1.1 percent year-on-year in October after a 3.8 percent rise in September and manufacturing output dropped 2.2 percent year-on-year, the National Statistics Service (NSS) said.</p>
</text>
